Dawg stop cheating 💔 

@psl_l_scout
max-visits: 1
go-to: scouting
on-arrival: {!
if (psl_l_relation >= 70) {
    daszynski_votes += psl_w_pres_votes;
    
    narutowicz_votes -= psl_w_pres_votes;

    psl_w_choice = 'Daszynski';
   }
!}

@psl_w_scout
max-visits: 1
go-to: scouting
on-arrival: {!
if (psl_w_relation >= 70 and narutowicz_votes > daszynski_votes) {
   }
!}

test

@psl_p_scout
max-visits: 1
go-to: scouting
on-arrival: {!
if (psl_p_relation >= 70 and daszynski_votes > wojciechowski_votes) {
    daszynski_votes += psl_p_pres_votes;
    daszynski_votes += npr_pres_votes;
    
    wojciechowski_votes -= psl_p_pres_votes;
    wojciechowski_votes -= npr_pres_votes;

    psl_p_choice = 'Daszynski';
    npr_choice = 'Daszynski';

    peasants_psl_p -= 4;
    petit_psl_p -= 3;
    peasants_zln += 3;
   }
!}

[? if psl_p_relation >= 70 and daszynski_votes > wojciechowski : They're convinced! They will support <span style="color: #C62828;">Daszyński</span>, They have also convinced the NPR to support our candidate. ?][? if psl_relation < 70 and daszynski_votes <= wojciechowski_votes : They aren't convinced. They know they are more popular than us, additionally, socialism is currently unpopular so supporting a socialist candidate may be harmful to their conservative agrarian bases. We can't win this election alone, we need support from other parties. ?]

@bmn_scout
max-visits: 1
go-to: scouting

The BMN delegates have respectfully declined supporting <span style="color: #C62828;">Daszyński</span> in the first round as a show of solidarity for minorities. perhaps we can convince them after they have dropped or after we've moved to the second round.

@scoutdone

The first round of voting has concluded.

